276 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 77 0 R
/T (In high-risk intelligence environments where traditional cryptographic traffic is flagged or actively blocked by state firewalls, operators utilize steganography to maintain secure channels. Field agents embed encrypted text files inside high-resolution digital photographs using Least Significant Bit \(LSB\) substitution algorithms. Because the modifications change the pixel color values by only a negligible fraction, the image appears perfectly normal to the naked eye and passes automated filters, allowing sensitive data to exit the area undetected. )
/E (In high-risk intelligence environments where traditional cryptographic traffic is flagged or actively blocked by state firewalls, operators utilize steganography to maintain secure channels. Field agents embed encrypted text files inside high-resolution digital photographs using Least Significant Bit \(LSB\) substitution algorithms. Because the modifications change the pixel color values by only a negligible fraction, the image appears perfectly normal to the naked eye and passes automated filters, allowing sensitive data to exit the area undetected. )
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [6]
