/Title (When evaluating which number-theoretic concept is most critical for public-key cryptography, a comprehensive analysis points directly to Euler's Generalization of Fermat's Theorem \(Euler's Theorem\), supported inherently by the computational efficiency of the Extended Euclidean Algorithm.)
/Dest [21 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 347 0 R
/Next 824 0 R
>>
