/Title (To demonstrate the operational realities of these relationships, we examine the precise mechanisms through which specific attacks materialize distinct threats, induce quantitative business risks, and are systematically counteracted by security controls aligned to the C-I-A triad.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 978 0 R
/Next 1194 0 R
>>
endobj
